The comprehensive caption, "systematic, progressive, related work,"in the present instance, has special reference to the regular four years'course; the four basic studies (see letter of appointment of November 14th, 1890); the four first books in the first year's reading course:

the consecutive, related lectures and sub jects; the home reading and preparation;

